    <item>
      <title>三星Z Fold 8热销致DDI芯片供应紧张 折叠屏供应链面临连锁压力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9FZ-Fold-8%E7%83%AD%E9%94%80%E8%87%B4DDI%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E7%B4%A7%E5%BC%A0-%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%B1%8F%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E8%BF%9E%E9%94%81%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9FZ-Fold-8%E7%83%AD%E9%94%80%E8%87%B4DDI%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E7%B4%A7%E5%BC%A0-%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%B1%8F%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E8%BF%9E%E9%94%81%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</guid>
      <description>三星Galaxy Z Fold 8因全新形态屏幕获消费者认可后销售火爆，其DDI显示驱动芯片供应已现紧张。该芯片由三星System LSI设计、联华电子以22nm制程生产，目前联华电子22nm制程已达极限，三星正要求其针对此机型增产。 三星Galaxy Z Fold 8的成功直接体现在消费者对它全新形态屏幕</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>小米18 Fold宣称1.2米抗跌落 雷军称可靠性媲美直板旗舰</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B318-Fold%E5%AE%A3%E7%A7%B01.2%E7%B1%B3%E6%8A%97%E8%B7%8C%E8%90%BD-%E9%9B%B7%E5%86%9B%E7%A7%B0%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%80%A7%E5%AA%B2%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B4%E6%9D%BF%E6%97%97%E8%88%B0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B318-Fold%E5%AE%A3%E7%A7%B01.2%E7%B1%B3%E6%8A%97%E8%B7%8C%E8%90%BD-%E9%9B%B7%E5%86%9B%E7%A7%B0%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%80%A7%E5%AA%B2%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B4%E6%9D%BF%E6%97%97%E8%88%B0/</guid>
      <description>雷军称小米18 Fold拥有1.2米抗跌落能力，可靠性媲美直板旗舰。相比MIX Fold 4，尖锐物体抗冲击性提升258%，钢球重物跌落高度提升214%。这款中折叠手机将于9月7日晚7点发布，首发玄戒O3处理器。 折叠屏手机上市多年，屏幕折痕、铰链松动、意外摔落后的损坏一直是用户最常抱怨的问题</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特努斯首日内部信点名iPhone 18与折叠Ultra将惊艳四座</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E7%89%B9%E5%8A%AA%E6%96%AF%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E4%BF%A1%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8DiPhone-18%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0Ultra%E5%B0%86%E6%83%8A%E8%89%B3%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%A7/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E7%89%B9%E5%8A%AA%E6%96%AF%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A5%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E4%BF%A1%E7%82%B9%E5%90%8DiPhone-18%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0Ultra%E5%B0%86%E6%83%8A%E8%89%B3%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%A7/</guid>
      <description>苹果新任CEO约翰·特努斯9月1日上任首日内部信中直言，下周发布会必将惊艳四座；同日曝光的iPhone 18 Pro Max与首款折叠iPhone Ultra机模，正指向这一产品管线。特努斯在信中仅用四段感谢库克过渡支持，并称苹果仍是世界上最伟大的公司。 特努斯首信锁定iPhone 18系列为现象</description>
    </item>
